    {
      "id": 24,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "SDK long-poll failures by operation · status code",
      "description": "Long-poll calls that failed, seen from the client side (omes worker and load client). RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED on PollWorkflowTaskQueue / PollActivityTaskQueue = the worker's polls rejected (exercise 2, ConcurrentLimit). DEADLINE_EXCEEDED on GetWorkflowExecutionHistory = the load client gave up waiting for a workflow result (exercise 1, RpsLimit). Rejected polls only matter if tasks start waiting: compare with workflow task schedule-to-start.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "$datasource"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (operation, status_code)(rate(temporal_long_request_failure[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} · {{status_code}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Task queue backlog (matching) — count and age",
      "description": "Tasks waiting in the omes task queue because no poll picked them up yet (summed across partitions; sticky queues excluded). Stays at 0 while pollers keep up — rejected polls alone don't create a backlog. A growing count with a growing age means workers can't poll fast enough: the consequence of a limit set below what the work needs.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 26
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "$datasource"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (taskqueue, task_type)(approximate_backlog_count{namespace=\"default\", taskqueue=~\"omes_.*\", partition!=\"__sticky__\"})",
          "legendFormat": "count · {{task_type}}"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "$datasource"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "max by (taskqueue, task_type)(approximate_backlog_age_seconds{namespace=\"default\", taskqueue=~\"omes_.*\", partition!=\"__sticky__\"})",
          "legendFormat": "age · {{task_type}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byFrameRefID",
              "options": "B"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.axisPlacement",
                "value": "right"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    10,
                    10
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
